# Project Context
We are building "PVS" (Personal Vocabulary Service) frontend.
- **Stack:** Next.js 15 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS.
- **State:** React Query (TanStack Query) for server state.
- **Backend:** .NET 9 API (external repo).

# Core Principles
- **Next.js 15:** Distinguish strictly between Server Components (default) and Client Components (`"use client"`).
- **React 19:** Use modern hooks where applicable, but prefer React Query for data fetching.
- **Preserve Logic:** Never remove existing business logic (navigation, handlers) when refactoring UI.
- **Pixel Perfect:** Design must match the provided mocks strictly.